<title>USA: Atlantic Beverage Q4 oper shr profit $0.03.</title>
<headline>Atlantic Beverage Q4 oper shr profit $0.03.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHBROOK, Ill. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.03     loss	 $0.18</p>
<p> Oper net		     224     loss	   425</p>
<p> Revs			42,350		    3,758</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 6,520		    2,323</p>
<p>	  YEAR</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.17     loss	 $0.06</p>
<p> Oper net		     896     loss	   152</p>
<p> Revs		     153,280		   20,596</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 5,350		    2,529</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: For Q4 ended Dec. 31, 1995, oper results excluded losses of $2.5 million related to discontinued operations or $1.10 per share.  1995 Q4 net after discontinued operations was a loss of $2,972,123 or $1.28 per share.</p>
<p>For the year ended Dec. 31, 1995, oper results excluded losses of $2.9 million related to discontinued operations. Net after discontinued operations was a loss of $3,090,586 or $1.22 per share.</p>
<p>Full company name is Atlantic Beverage Company Inc.</p>
